<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Lusu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lusu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lusu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lusu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Lusu chosimulila vinhu vikulu vinogile vovilawilile kwa kaye imwe ya Waisilaili muna ulusita lwa Wasemi wa Isilaili. Naomi, mama wa kaye ino, kafunya umoyo lusita wa chililo chikulu viya mulumake na wanage waidi wa chilume viwadanganike lusita viwakalile muna iisi ya chigeni uko Moabu. Viyafosile yayo, Naomi katemeligwa mate lusita Lusu yoyakalile imwe wa wakoi zake na mkaya wa isi ya Moabu viyalamule mwenyewo kuilumba nayo na kamulaganila kumtaza. Naomi kosegela na Lusu kubwela kuna iisi yake mwenyewo ya Isilaili. Viyamalile yayo Lusu na Naomi wose watemeligwa mate na Boazi viyatogole kuwalolesa goya na kumsola Lusu. Lusita lwa Wasemi lukala wiha kwa viya Waisilaili wengi wakala bila ya kuzindilila malagilizo, mbali Naomi na Lusu na Boazi wakala Waisilaili wasondelele malagilizo ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Haimanyika yelihi yandike chitabu cha Lusu. Iviya mwaka wa kwandikigwa chitabu chino haumanyika bule, mbali wamwenga wogesa kuwa chitabu chandikigwa viya Waisilaili viwabwelile kuna iisi ya chigeni ya utumwa. Chovimanya kwa kuona viya Chiebulaniya chochisang'haniligwe umo kwandika chitabu chino ni Chiebulaniya cha lusita luja. Ni mbuli ya maana kuvimanya kuwa mfalume Daudi kakala mzukulu wa Lusu mwanamke yakalile siyo Muisilaili. Ino yolagusa kuwa Yesu kalawa muna uwelesi wa Lusu. Mbuli ino yolagusa ukweli kuwa, kumuhuwila Mulungu hakuilinga na kusaguligwa chilukolo, mbali kusondelela moyo wa munhu viwili.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sula ya 1 yosimulila viya Naomi viyapatile ndilo ng'hulu na viya Naomi na Lusu viwabwelile muna isi ya Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Muna isula 2 chosoma viya Lusu viyaiting'hane na Boazi lusita Lusu viyakalile kosalala muna umgunda wa Boazi.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Sula ya 3 yosimulila viya Naomi viyamulagilize Lusu kumulamba Boazi yamsole na kumulolesa goya kwaviya kakala ndugu yake Naomi. Nayo Boazi katogola.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Sula ya 4 yolagusa viya Boazi viyamsolile Lusu na viyagulile mgunda woukalile wa mulumake Naomi yadanganike.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Naomi kawa mgane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Baho umwaka, wasemi viwakalile wotawala muna iisi ya Isilaili, kulawilila nzala ng'hulu. Munhu kulawa Beselehemu muna iisi ya Yuda, hamwe na muke wake na wanage waidi wa chilume wahita kukala fana nyambenyambe muna iisi ya Moabu. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Munhu iyo katangigwa Elimeleki na muke wake katangigwa Naomi. Wana wawo waidi wa chilume, imwe katangigwa Mahiloni na imwenga Kilioni. Wawo wakala Waefulasi kulawa Beselehemu muna iisi ya Yuda. Wahita muna iisi ya Moabu na wakala uko. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Maabaho Elimeleki mulumake Naomi kadanganika. Naomi kalekiligwa wana waidi wa chilume. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Wabwanga wawo wasola wandele wa Chimoabu, imwe katangigwa Olipa na imwenga Lusu. Viifosile miyaka longo, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />wose waidi, Mahiloni na Kilioni nawo wadanganika. Ivo Naomi kadanganikilwa na wanage wa chilume na mulumake.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi na Lusu wobwela Beselehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Ivo Naomi viyahulike kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kawatemela mate wanhu wake kwa kuweng'ha ndiya, kalamula kusegela Moabu kubwela kumwake hamwe na wakoi zake. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Yeye hamwe na wakoi zake wasegela haja hawakalile , wamhisa nzila kubwela kuna iisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Naomi kawalongela waja wakoi zake waidi, “Chila imwe yabwele ukaye kwa mami yake. Mndewa Mulungu yamulaguseni ulondo wake fana vimulaguse kumwangu na kwa wanangu waja wadanganike. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Mndewa Mulungu yamnogeleni chila imwe wenu yakale goya ukaye kwa mulume imwenga.” Maabaho Naomi kawalaga kwa kuwanonela, mbali wawo walila ng'hani. <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Wamulongela, “Mawe! Chizahita hamwe na weye kwa wanhu wako.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Mbali Naomi kalonga, “Bweleni ukaye wakoi zangu. Habali munisondelele? Vino mweye mogesa nodaha kweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume wamsoleni? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Bweleni ukaye wakoi zangu, kwaviya niye mulala sidaha kupata mulume. Hata one nilongile ninajo huwilo, hata one nipatile mulume ichilo cha diyelo na kupata wana, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />vino muhadahile kugozela mbaka wakule? Vino muhadahile kuikimilila sekemusoligwe na walume wamwenga? Siivo wandele zangu! Mbuli iyo ndala kumwangu kufosa mweye, mana Mndewa Mulungu kaniheleleza.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Baho walila kwa giyogiyo kaidi. Maabaho Olipa kamulaga mkoi wake kwa kumnonela, mbali Lusu kamnanahila. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Naomi kalonga, “Lusu, lola mzengele miyago kabwela kwa wanhu wake na kwa milungu yake, lelo na weye bwela umsondelele mzengele miyago.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Lusu kamwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">“Sekeunilambe nikuleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">hebu sekeunigome kukusondelela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Kokose kondauhite niuko kondanihite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">na hondaukale baho hondanikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">wanhu wako wezakuwa wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Mulungu wako kezakuwa Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="RUT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Hondaudanganikile na niye nizadananikila baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">hondauwandigwe na niye nizawandigwa baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">one nihakuleka weye, ila kwa ifa muhala, Mndewa Mulungu yanitaguse ng'hani.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi viyawonile kuwa Lusu kalamula kumsondelela, kaleka kulonga nayo. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Ivo wose waidi wagendelela na umwanza mbaka Beselehemu. Viwafikile uko, wanhu wose wazanywa, mbaka wanaake waiuza, “Ino Naomi?” <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi kawalongela, “Sekemunitange Naomi, nitangeni Mala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fq">Sekemunitange Naomi, nitangeni Mala </char> <char style="ft" closed="false">Usungu kwa Chiebulaniya ni Mala. Naomi kwa Chiebulaniya fambulo jake deng'ho na Mala fambulo jake usungu. </char></note>, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu katenda nikale kwa usungu ng'hani. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Nisegela hano kuno nimemezigwa, mbali sambi Mndewa Mulungu kanibweleza makono muhala. Habali monitanga Naomi na Mndewa Mulungu kaniheleleza, Mndewa Mulungu yeli na udahi kanitenda nikale kwa usungu?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Ivo niivo Naomi viyabwelile kulawa kuna iisi ya Moabu hamwe na Lusu Mmoabu yeli mkoi wake. Wafika Beselehemu chipindi cha kugobola shayili chokwandusa.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Lusu koiting'hana na Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Kukala na munhu yatangigwe Boazi yolawa muna ulukolo lumwe na Elimeleki mulumake Naomi. Iyo kakala tajili na kamanyika ng'hani. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Siku dimwe Lusu Mmoabu kamulongela Naomi, “Nitogolele nihite kumgunda nikasalale. Nodaha kumpata munhu yondayanitogolele kusalala kuchisogo chake.” Naomi kamulongela, “Haya, hita mndele wangu.” <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Ivo Lusu kahita kumgunda, kawasondelela waja wagobolaji kuchisogo muladi yakasalale, mbali havimanyile kuwa mgunda uja wa Boazi, ija wa lukolo lumwe na Elimeleki.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Maabaho Boazi kafika kulawa Beselehemu na kawalamsa wagobolaji, “Mndewa Mulungu yawe na mweye!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Wawo wamwidika, “Mndewa Mulungu yakutemele mate!” <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boazi kamuuza mwimilizi wa wagobolaji, “Mwali ino wa yelihi?” <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Nayo kamwidika, “Ino ni Mmoabu yabwelile na Naomi kulawa muna iisi ya Moabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Kanipula nimulekele yawasondelele wagobolaji kuchisogo muladi yakasalale hagati ya miganda. Kasang'hana usang'hano kwandusila imitondo, sambi kahita kuhumula kuna ichizewe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Ivo Boazi kamulongela Lusu, “Mwali wangu tegeleza, sekeuhite kusalala hanhu hamwenga ila muna umgunda uno muhala. Isondelele na wasang'hani wangu wa chike. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Lola hanhu howogobola usalale kuchisogo yawo. Niwazuma wabwanga wano sekewakugaze. Uhawona ng'hilu hita ukang'we mazi kuna ing'hupulilo yowatekile wasang'hani wano.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Lusu kamtumbalila mavindi Boazi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi, kamulongela, “Nipataze kutogoleligwa na weye? Habali koniwonela ubazi niye nili nyambenyambe?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boazi kamwidika, “Nihulika mbuli zose ziumtendele mkoi wako kwandusila mulumako viyadanganike. Nivimanya viya viuwalekile tati yako na mami yako, kuileka isi yako yowelekigwe na kwiza kukala kwa wanhu hawakumanyile. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Mndewa Mulungu yakulihe kwa chila chinhu chiutendile. Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili youmkimbilile muladi yakukalize fana viya kolo da nguku vidikaliza wanage.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Lusu kamwidika, “Mwenevale wangu, kunitendela mbuli zinogile ng'hani, ingawa niye sili imwe wa wasang'hani wako. Kuniguma moyo na kulonga na niye kwa uhole.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Lusita lwa ndiya, Boazi kamgoneka Lusu kamulongela, “Izo hano uje gate na udizanhike muna umsuzi.” Ivo Lusu kakala hamwe na wagobolaji, Boazi kamwing'ha mhule zikanzingigwe. Kaja mbaka keguta na kasigaza. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Lusu viyagendelele kusalala, Boazi kawalagiliza wasang'hani wake, “Mulekeni yasalale mbaka hana imiganda, sekemumkalikile. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Somoleni makungwi kulawa muna imiganda na muyaleke muladi yadondole na sekemumkalikile.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Ivo Lusu kakala yosalala muna umgunda mbaka ichigulogulo. Viyahulule shayili kapata debe dimwe na chidogo. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Kaitwika kahita kuna dibululu, kamulagusila mkoi wake shayili iyasalale. Iviya kalava ndiya iyasigaze viyegute, kamwing'ha. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Mkoi wake kamuuza, “Kusalala kulihi ino yose? Kukala kuna umgunda wa yelihi? Mulungu yamtemele mate munhu yakutazile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Maabaho Lusu kamulongela mkoi wake kuwa kakala muna umgunda wa munhu yatangigwe Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naomi kamulongela Lusu, “Mndewa Mulungu yamtemele mate Boazi! Mulungu kofikiza chilagano chake kwa wagima na wadanganike. Munhu iyo ndugu yetu wa habehi, ndolezi muna ulukolo lwetu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Maabaho Lusu Mmoabu kalonga, “Iviya kanilongela, ‘Usigale hano na wasang'hani wangu mbaka vondawakomeleze kugobola.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi kamulongela Lusu, “Mndele wangu, vinoga kusang'hana usang'hano na wanaake wamwenga muna umgunda wa Boazi, kwaviya one uhitile kuna umgunda wa munhu imwenga yodahika wahakugazile.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Ivo Lusu kasang'hana usang'hano hamwe na wasang'hani wa chike wa Boazi. Kasalala mbaka viwakomeleze kugobola ngano na shayili. Kakala yokala na mkoi wake.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Lusu kozahililigwa mulume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Siku dimwe Naomi kamulongela Lusu, “Mndele wangu vinoga nikuzahilile mulume muladi ukale goya. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Vino, ino Boazi yousang'hane hamwe na wasang'hani wake wa chike, siyo wa lukolo lwetu? Lelo tegeleza, ichigulogulo kezakuwa kobeta shayili hanhu ha kuhululila. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Ivo oge na uibobode mavuta yonung'ha goya na uyawale vinogile, maabaho uhite hanhu hoyohululila, mbali uiteganye sekeumanyike kumwake mbaka vondayakomeleze kuja na kung'wa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Iviya uhamanye hanhu hondayagone, yahakukila, muhitile ugaluga umgubule vizegeyu vake na utambalale hajahaja. Kezakulongela cha kutenda.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Lusu kedika, “Nizatenda chochose choulonga.” <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Ivo Lusu kahita hanhu ha kuhululila na katenda chila chinhu chiyalongeligwe na mkoi wake.<verse eid="RUT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boazi viyakomeleze kuja na kung'wa, kadeng'helela muna umoyo wake. Ivo kahita kuinzingo ya dibugulu da shayili kugona. Lusu kahita ugaluga, kamgubula vizegeyu vake na kagona.<verse eid="RUT 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ichilo chikulu, Boazi kagumhuka, kahinduka na kamuwona mwanamke kagona muna yamagulu yake.<verse eid="RUT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Kamuuza, “Weye iyo yelihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Lusu kamwidika, “Niye Lusu msang'hani wako. Kwaviya weye ndolezi wangu, unigubike na mhindo ya walo jako fana chilaguso cha ukalizi wako, niye msang'hani wako.” <verse eid="RUT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boazi kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu yakutemele mate mwali wangu, yaja youtenda sambi yanoga kufosa yaja youtendile ichanduso, kwaviya humzahile mbwanga imwenga yawe ngayengaye hebu yawe tajili. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Lelo mwali wangu sekeudumbe, nizakutendela chila chinhu chiupulile, kwaviya wanhu wose muna dibululu wavimanya kuwa weye mwanamke yanogile. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Kweli niye ndolezi, mbali kuna ndolezi yeli habehi ng'hani kufosa niye. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Kala hano ichilo chino, igolo imitondo chizawona fana kezatogola kukulola goya hebu kukulema. One yahakulola goya, vinoga. Yahalema, kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu yeli mgima, nizakulola goya. Gona hano mbaka imitondo.” <verse eid="RUT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ivo Lusu kagona muna yamagulu ya Boazi mbaka imitondo, mbali kalamka chilochilo muladi sekeyawoneke, kwaviya Boazi halondile munhu yavimanye kuwa mwanamke kakala hanhu ha kuhululila.<verse eid="RUT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Maabaho Boazi kalonga, “Ning'he walo jako diuyawale uditandike hasi.” Lusu katenda ivo, nayo kamwikila debe da shayili na kamtwika. Maabaho kabwela kuna dibululu. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Lusu viyafikile, Naomi kamuuza, “Iwaze mndele wangu?” Lusu kamulongela chila chinhu chiyamtendele Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Maabaho kagendelela kulonga, “Kaning'ha debe da shayili, kalonga, ‘Sekeubwele kwa mkoi wako makono muhala.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naomi kalonga, “Mkoi wangu, gozela mbaka uwone chondachilawilile, kwaviya Boazi hezahumula mbaka mbuli zikale goya diyelo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boazi komsola Lusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boazi kahita kuna ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu hana ihanhu ha kuiting'hanila, kakala uko. Ndolezi ija iyamtambule Boazi keza habehi. Ivo Boazi kalonga, “Izo habehi ndugu yangu, kala hano.” Munhu iyo keza na kakala hasi. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Maabaho Boazi kawatanga walala longo wa bululu, nawo iviya kawalongela, “Kaleni hasi,” nawo wakala. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Boazi kamulongela ija ndugu yake, “Naomi yabwelile kulawa Moabu, kolonda kuchuuza mgunda ukalile wa ndugu yetu Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Niona vinoga nikulongele mbuli ino. One uhalonda kuukombola mgunda uwo, ukombole haulongozi wa walala wa wanhu wangu. Ulonge one koulonda hebu huulonda, kwaviya munhu wa mwanduso kukombola weye na wekaidi iyo niye.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:4">Nayo kamwidika, “Nizaukombola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Maabaho Boazi kalonga, “Siku yondaugule mgunda kwa Naomi, iviya kwizalondeka kumsola Lusu yeli Mmoabu, muke wa mwenekwaga, muladi mgunda uwo usigale kwa ndugu wa mwenekwaga na kugendeleza lukolo.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Ivo ija ndolezi yakalile wa habehi kalonga, “Sidaha kuukombola niye mwenyewo, muladi sekeniubanange uhazi wa wanangu. Haki yangu ya kuukombola isole weye, kwaviya niye sidaha kuukombola.” <verse eid="RUT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Siku ziya muna iisi ya Isilaili wanhu wahalonda kukombola hebu kugula chinhu, chikala chihendo kwa munhu kulagusa chilaguso cha kuvula chilatu chake na kumwing'ha imwenga. Kwa chilaguso icho Waisilaili walagusa kuitogolela muumwingi.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Ivo munhu ija kamulongela Boazi, “Gula weye.” Maabaho kavula chilatu chake.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Boazi kawalongela walala na wanhu wose, “Mweye wakalangama diyelo kuwa nigula kwa Naomi vinhu vose va Elimeleki na Kilioni na Mahiloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Iviya nimsola Lusu yeli Mmoabu, mgane wa Mahiloni, yawe muke wangu, muladi kuditenda zina da mwenekwaga kugendelela hamwe na vinhu vake, ivo zina jake sekejage mwa ndugu zake hebu muna dibululu jake. Diyelo mwawakalangama!”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Maabaho wanhu wose wakalile hana ulwivi na walala, walonga, “Cheye wakalangama. Mndewa Mulungu yamtende mwanamke ino yokwingila muna ikaye yako yawe fana Laheli na Leya, wose waidi waizenga kaye ya Isilaili. Na weye ukale goya mwa wanhu wa Efulasi na uwe na nhogolwa uko Beselehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Kwa welesi wondayakwing'he Mndewa Mulungu kufosela muke iyo, kaye yako ilinge fana kaye ya Pelesi, ija Tamali iyamwelekele Yuda.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Ivo Boazi kamsola Lusu kawa muke wake. Viyambandame, Mndewa Mulungu kamtenda yapate wimo na kavumbula mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Wanaake wamulongela Naomi, “Yatogozigwe Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya hakulekile diyelo upuwe mzukulu wa kukulola goya. Zina jake dimanyike ng'hani muna iisi ya Isilaili. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Kezakubwelezela ugima wako na kukulola goya muna uulala wako. Kwaviya mkoi wako yokulonda ng'hani na yokufaya ng'hani kufosa wana wa chilume saba, kavumbula mwana wa chilume.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi kamsola mwana iyo kamwika muna imhambaga yake na kumulela.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Wanaake wa habehi wamtanga mwana iyo Obedi na walonga, “Naomi kapata mwana wa chilume.” Obedi viyakulile mkulu kamweleka Yese tati yake Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Uno uwo welesi wa Pelesi. Pelesi kamweleka Hesiloni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hesiloni kamweleka Lamu, Lamu kamweleka Aminadabu, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabu kamweleka Nashoni, Nashoni kamweleka Salimoni, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salimoni kamweleka Boazi, Boazi kamweleka Obedi, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi kamweleka Yese, Yese kamweleka Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>